75477>>>>>External_Function WNetGetUserW "WNetGetUserW" MPR.DLL ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75478>>>>>
75478>>>>>// Wrapper Function WNetGetUser
75478>>>>>Function WNetGetUser Global ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75480>>>>>    
75480>>>>>    DWord   dwResult     
75480>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75480>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75480>>>>>        
75480>>>>>    Send StringToWide lpName (&uwName)
75481>>>>>    
75481>>>>>    Send WideSetBuffer lpUser_Name lpLength (&uwUserName)    
75482>>>>>    
75482>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (uwName.lpUText, uwUserName.lpUText, lpLength)) to dwResult
75483>>>>>    
75483>>>>>    Send WideToString (&uwUserName) lpUser_Name
75484>>>>>    
75484>>>>>    Function_Return dwResult
75485>>>>>End_Function
