75486>>>>>//    This function reads the current username Of windows and returns that
75486>>>>>//    name or an text unknown user
75486>>>>>Function Network_User_Name for cDesktop Returns String
75488>>>>>    WString wName
75488>>>>>    Integer iRetval iLength
75488>>>>>    
75488>>>>>    Move 0 to iLength
75489>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, 0, AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75490>>>>>    Move (ZeroString(iLength)) to wName
75491>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, AddressOf (wName), AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75492>>>>>    
75492>>>>>    If (iRetval = NO_ERROR) Begin
75494>>>>>        Function_Return (CString (wName))
75495>>>>>    End
75495>>>>>>
75495>>>>>    
75495>>>>>    Function_Return "User Unknown"
75496>>>>>End_Function
